# Apache settings for the hosted copy.

# The OpenCascade (STEP/IGES) and Draco decoders are WebAssembly. Browsers refuse
# to stream-compile a .wasm that is not served as application/wasm.
AddType application/wasm .wasm

# Deliberately NOT set: Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy / Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy.
# Kaamos does not use SharedArrayBuffer or multithreaded wasm (checked), and COEP
# would block any resource loaded from another origin.
